    "sentence_translations": [
      "I Started to Like Someone",
      "",
      "Little Yu saw that Ben had written a phrase in his notebook: “I started to like someone”.",
      "",
      "Little Yu thought to herself: “This is Ben’s writing. He has someone he likes?”",
      "",
      "Little Yu was a bit unhappy, but when she thought about it, this phrase can have many meanings.",
      "Depending on where you split the words, the meaning changes.",
      "“Wo xihuan shang yi ge ren” means “I started to like someone”;",
      "“Wo xihuan shang / yi ge ren” becomes “I started to like being alone, just alone, and not together with others”;",
      "“Wo xihuan / shang yi ge ren” means “I don’t like the current person, I like my ex”;",
      "“Wo xihuan / shang / yi ge ren” becomes “I like to have intimate relations with someone”;",
      "",
      "Little Yu really wants to know which one is the meaning of the phrase in Ben’s notebook.",
      ""
    ]
